3
00:15:37,760 --> 00:15:48,600
Deputy Speaker Janette L. Garin: Any objection? Hearing none, the proposed budget, the period of sponsorship, debate and interpellation of the proposed budget of the Energy Regulatory Commission is hereby open. Majority Leader.

4
00:15:48,600 --> 00:15:57,680
Rep. Daphne A. Lagon: Madam Speaker, may we acknowledge the heads and officials of the Energy Regulatory Commission,

5
