Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I think may threshold sila dyan, eh, sa ginagawa.

100
00:28:40,260 --> 00:28:45,660
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: I hope, no, the Senate will act on it para naman matugunan yung problema.

101
00:28:47,480 --> 00:28:48,480
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: Madam Speaker,

102
00:28:48,840 --> 00:28:54,120
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: let me now go to what the additional funding is supposed to accomplish.

103
00:28:54,620 --> 00:28:58,500
Rep. Presley C. De Jesus: The most obvious example is the rate reset backlog.

104
00:28:58,640 --> 00:28:59,800
