Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: Approval of fit all to update the rates when it resumed collection.

1516
01:19:18,320 --> 01:19:23,680
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: 2024, fit all was only approved March 2024.

1517
01:19:24,740 --> 01:19:29,620
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: And 2025, fit all was only approved November 2025.

1518
01:19:30,960 --> 01:19:36,180
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: As of August, 356 million of payable outstanding.

1519
01:19:37,020 --> 01:19:41,260
Rep. Arnie B. Fuentebella: By December, this will be fully paid, Madam Speaker.

1520
01:19:42,320 --> 01:19:42,940
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Madam Speaker,

1521
01:19:42,960 --> 01:19:48,240
