2377
03:58:32,540 --> 03:58:35,800
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Honorable Reynante Arogancia of the 3rd District of Quezon.

2378
03:58:38,340 --> 03:58:52,800
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mr. Speaker, distinguished colleagues, I rise today, I sit today to sponsor the proposed budget of the Department of Transportation for Fiscal Year 2027.

2379
03:58:55,180 --> 03:59:02,520
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Every day, millions of Filipinos spend hours in traffic, waiting in long lines at terminals,

2380
03:59:02,520 --> 03:59:10,720
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: and endure uncertain commutes just to get to work, to school, or home to their families.

2381
03:59:12,160 --> 03:59:14,520
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Transportation is not merely about infrastructure.

2382
03:59:16,600 --> 03:59:23,800
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: It is about time, opportunity, and dignity of our people, for our people.

2383
03:59:24,940 --> 03:59:27,760
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: This budget responds to that reality.

2384
03:59:28,660 --> 03:59:32,160
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Through strategic investments in modern railways,

2385
03:59:32,520 --> 03:59:37,800
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: safer roads, efficient airports, and stronger maritime facilities,

2386
03:59:38,940 --> 03:59:42,480
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: we are building a transport system that eases congestion,

2387
03:59:43,400 --> 03:59:48,620
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: improves safety, and connects communities across our archipelago,

2388
03:59:48,620 --> 03:59:54,500
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: from the busiest urban centers to our most remote islands.

2389
03:59:57,560 --> 04:00:00,400
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: A reliable transport networks moves more

2390
04:00:00,400 --> 04:00:15,100
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: people and goods. It moves the economy forward. It opens markets for our farmers and fisherfolk, brings jobs closer to our workers, and ensures that no region is left behind in our pursuit of growth.

2391
04:00:17,620 --> 04:00:26,740
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Mr. Speaker, supporting this budget therefore means supporting mobility, productivity, and inclusive development for every Filipino.

2392
04:00:26,740 --> 04:00:34,820
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: It is an investment not only in steel, concrete, and runways, but in the future of our nation.

2393
04:00:36,400 --> 04:00:48,800
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: It is with this conviction that I respectfully urge this August Chamber to approve the proposed budget of the Department of Transportation for the fiscal year 2027.

2394
04:00:50,000 --> 04:00:52,820
