Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: sometimes plastic na...

5247
06:44:07,320 --> 06:44:08,320
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Bollard.

5248
06:44:08,320 --> 06:44:14,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Bollard. Okay. Yung class 1, yung talagang...

5249
06:44:14,320 --> 06:44:15,320
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: New. Yung bago.

5250
06:44:15,320 --> 06:44:20,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: O bago. At saka, is it elevated? Ganun po ba? Hiwalay?

5251
06:44:20,320 --> 06:44:22,320
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Tama. Tama, dear colleague. Sidewalk.

5252
06:44:22,320 --> 06:44:30,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. At paano po, hindi lang naman siklista, paano po yung sa pedestrians at saka PWD? Ano naman po ang gagawin?

5253
06:44:30,320 --> 06:44:35,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Para sa mga pedestrian at PWD?

5254
06:44:35,320 --> 06:44:38,320
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Sa class 1 yan, dear colleague. Sidewalk.

5255
06:44:38,320 --> 06:44:44,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Sidewalk. Okay. Sidewalks with PWD access. Yan lang po ba?

5256
06:44:44,320 --> 06:44:46,320
Rep. Edwin Ongchuan: Sidewalk expansion, dear colleague.

5257
06:44:46,320 --> 06:44:58,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Okay. Alright. Well, Mr. Speaker, needless to say, sinusuportahan po natin ang panukala para sa additional 1.2...

5258
06:44:58,320 --> 06:44:59,320
Rep. Antonio L. Tinio: Billion.

5259
06:44:59,320 --> 06:45:00,320
